# SAT Calculator

An interactive web-based calculator designed to support
students in understanding and analyzing SAT scores.

## 🎯 Objective

This project was developed as an educational tool to help
students interpret SAT results and explore score calculations
in an accessible and interactive way.

## 🚀 Live Demo

[Access the SAT Calculator](https://calculadora-sat-vercel-oficial.vercel.app/)

## 💡 Features

- Interactive SAT score calculation
- User-friendly interface
- Instant results
- Designed for educational use
- Responsive web interface

## 📚 Educational Purpose

The calculator was developed to support students preparing
for the SAT by providing an accessible way to interact with
score-related information.

The project combines educational methodology with web
development to create a practical digital learning tool.

## 🛠️ Technologies

- JavaScript
- HTML
- CSS
- Vercel

## 🌐 Deployment

The application is deployed using Vercel and is available
online for direct use.

